TITLE

REMOTE SESSION + OPERATING CONTEXT FOUNDATION V1


MISSION

Introduce the first concrete remote operating-context relationship in Synthesis.

A successful Credential Access attempt already creates persistent DeviceAccess.

This task adds the next distinct gameplay concept:

DeviceAccess
    ↓
CONNECT
    ↓
active Remote Session
    ↓
DISCONNECT
    ↓
DeviceAccess remains

The purpose of this slice is to establish:

ACCESS ≠ ACTIVE CONNECTION

and to create the canonical gameplay state that the first foreign Device /
Firmware operating surface will consume in the next milestone.

This is a gameplay and architecture slice.

It is not yet the foreign-server UI milestone.


