the current NODE-OS Terminal does NOT become a shell on 198.51.100.47.

Existing local commands must retain their current meaning.

In particular, after CONNECT:

- `ip` still reports the local NODE-OS Device address
- `status` still reports the local NODE-OS Device runtime
- local filesystem commands from the previous milestone still read the local
